+    N > 0 applies the budget only once the current level has seen N actions without a level change. The session loop
+    (solver.py) measures the stall and sets `ToolAgent._think_budget_stall_active` before each turn; a fresh level turns
+    the budget off again. The canon of the uniform budget (docs/frz_think_budget_2026-10-04.md section 8) lost its
+    levels on games that were progressing through short levels (cd82 / r11l: every level under 35 actions) and gained
+    on games stalled mid-way, which this gate separates (B's completed levels: median 21 actions, p90 73)."""
+    return max(0, _get_env_int("ECA_FRZ_THINK_BUDGET_STALL_ACTIONS", 0))
